inishers) are awesome. I would've add more variants, but it feels random so it doesn't bore you out that quickly when using melee combat. :)\n\nOverall 8.5/10 \n(will play the rest of the campaign/Story mode when I have the time) 👍", "timestamp_created": 1691353971, "timestamp_updated": 1691353971, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "143534126", "author": {"steamid": "76561197983417739", "personaname": "LORDJESSIAH", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197983417739/", "num_games_owned": 3028, "num_reviews": 221, "playtime_forever": 2705, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2705, "last_played": 1581296787, "avatar": "171a2e5dee9892daf62ed840ef4104336aa20977"}, "language": "english", "review": "7/10 A fantastic WH40K Game with great if a bit overly repetitive gameplay", "timestamp_created": 1691340849, "timestamp_updated": 1691340849, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "143532307", "author": {"steamid": "76561199164319443", "personaname": "Lloyd XMas", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199164319443/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 162, "playtime_forever": 259, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 259, "last_played": 1691338861, "avatar": "974f500fe1fb9df114835303c0942887575b82bd"}, "language": "english", "review": "combat is real fun, a joy to play. May not be super long, but because the combat is so good I can see myself coming back and playing this multiple times in the future.", "timestamp_created": 1691338948, "timestamp_updated": 1691338948, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "143510535", "author": {"steamid": "76561198020408535", "personaname": "Unsound Logician", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/SufferMeNow/", "num_games_owned": 277, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 1000, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 898, "last_played": 1691648329, "avatar": "52427553e15b88be59688839d2116dd3be354491"}, "language": "english", "review": "Replaying this after so many years.... it's still the only game where you can feel like you're a Space Marine doing the Emperor's bidding up close. The combat loop is pretty stellar - wanna heal? EXECUTE SOMETHING and the enemies it throws at you keep things challenging.\n\nHolds up pretty well.", "timestamp_created": 1691314716, "timestamp_updated": 1691314716, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.553483784198760986", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}